#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:5
msgid "Rotate text"
msgstr "旋转文字"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:7
msgid "The content from a `text field`_ can be rotated in two different ways:"
msgstr "`文本字段 <text field_>`_ 的内容可以两种不同的方式旋转："

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:9
msgid "Rotating the `text field`_ as an object."
msgstr "旋转 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 作为对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:10
msgid "Defining the text orientation inside the `text field`_."
msgstr "定义 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 中的文本方向。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:13
msgid "Rotate text field"
msgstr "旋转文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:15
msgid ""
"The text field is considered an object by QElectroTech, it can be selected, "
"placed and rotated as `elements`_ and `pictures`_. It can be rotated *90*, "
"*180* or *270* degrees."
msgstr ""
"文字字段被QElectroTech视为对象，可以选择，放置和旋转为 `元件 <elements_>`_ 和 `图片 <pictures_>`_，可以旋转"
" *90*,*180* 或 *270* 度。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:18
msgid "Right click on the `text field`_ which should be rotated."
msgstr "右键点击应当旋转的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:23
#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:46
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:25
msgid ""
"Select the option **Rotate** to rotate the `text field`_ *90* degrees on the"
" clock direction."
msgstr "选择 **旋转** 在时钟方向旋转 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ *90* 度 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:29
msgid ""
"For more information about rotating objects at the `workspace`_, refer to "
"`rotate object section`_."
msgstr ""
"关于在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 旋转物体的更多信息，参见 `旋转物体部分 <rotate object section_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:32
msgid "Define text orientation"
msgstr "定义文本方向"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:34
msgid ""
"Defining the text orientation rotates only the content from the `text "
"field`_. The advantage of choosing the text orientation is the possibility "
"to choose any angle between *-360* and *360* degrees."
msgstr ""
"定义文本方向只旋转 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 的内容。选择文本方向的好处是在 *-360* 和 *360* "
"度之间选择任意角度的可能性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:39
msgid "Define text orientation from workspace"
msgstr "从工作空间定义文本方向"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:41
msgid "Right click on the `text field`_ which should be oriented."
msgstr "右键单击应当面向的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:48
msgid ""
"Select the option **Choose text orientation** to display the text "
"orientation PopUP window."
msgstr "选择选项 **选择文本方向** 以显示文本方向 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:53
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech choose orientation PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 选择方向 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:55
msgid "Define the orientation angle of the text."
msgstr "定义文本的方向角度。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:56
msgid "Press **OK** to save the changes."
msgstr "按 **OK** 保存更改。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:59
msgid "Define text orientation from selection properties panel"
msgstr "从选择属性面板定义文本方向"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:61
msgid "Select the `text field`_ which should be oriented."
msgstr "选择应当面向的 `文本字段 <text field_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:62
msgid ""
"Define the orientation angle of the text at **Angle** field from `selection "
"properties panel`_."
msgstr "从 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 定义文本在 **Angle** 字段的方向角。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:67
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field selection properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 文本字段选择属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/text/text_rotate.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示"
